      "writtenOn": "2023-01-12T18:16:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The scenarios should be mutually exclusive, right? If the partner is self-powered, it won\u0027t need to wait for us to supply 15W to offer TBT (ignoring that this is the wrong way to do it). If the partner is not self-powered, it won\u0027t need to discover the cable to decide whether to offer 5A.",
